{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! Fresh safe flour arrived today and we are back to baking. All refunds have been processed. Come to the co‑op for fresh loaves – the first 5 customers receive a free extra roll. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "The new flour shipment arrived this morning; start baking immediately. Kai B., please oversee dough preparation, Milo handle the sales desk, and Gus monitor quality control. Ensure all recalled loaves are disposed of safely. Aim to have fresh bread ready for sale by midday and sell out by day's end.",
  "reason": "Day 3 we can resume safe sales and need to coordinate production while reassuring villagers."
