  "public_post": "Day 3 update: safe flour has not arrived yet, so we are continuing to use the farm stand for today’s bread. Please return any loaves bought yesterday for a full refund. We expect to have safe flour and resume co‑op baking tomorrow.",
  "coop_message": "Team, please confirm: Ben – process all refunds today; Kai D – set up a collection point for returned loaves; Milo – contact the regional mill for a safe flour shipment (expected arrival day 3); meet at 3 PM to finalize the plan and update the village board.",
  "reason": "We need to keep villagers informed while coordinating refunds and securing safe flour to restart sales."
