{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! Fresh, safe bread is back today – the contaminated batch has been fully recalled and all refunds processed. Come to the co‑op for fresh loaves; the first 10 customers receive a free extra roll. Thank you for supporting the co‑op!",
  "coop_message": "All refunds have been confirmed for the 30 residents. Safe‑flour baking is underway and we’ll open sales at 9 AM. Milo, please run the sales desk; Kai D, oversee quality control; Gus, monitor inventory and restock as needed. Let’s aim to sell out by day‑end and track any health reports.",
